<p data-start=3D"1368" data-end=3D"1498">The part of the code where the pro=
cess <strong data-start=3D"1407" data-end=3D"1437">exits the critical secti=
on</strong> and <strong data-start=3D"1442" data-end=3D"1477">signals other=
 waiting processes</strong> that they may enter.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1500" data-end=3D"1620">
<p data-start=3D"1503" data-end=3D"1527"><strong data-start=3D"1503" data-e=
nd=3D"1525">Remainder Section:</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1531" data-end=3D"1620">
<li data-start=3D"1531" data-end=3D"1620">
<p data-start=3D"1533" data-end=3D"1620">The rest of the code outside the c=
ritical section where <strong data-start=3D"1589" data-end=3D"1619">no shar=
ed resource is used</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
