<h3 data-start=3D"1797" data-end=3D"1848"><strong data-start=3D"1801" data-=
end=3D"1848">Requirements of a Critical Section Solution</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1850" data-end=3D"1947">Any correct solution to the <stron=
g data-start=3D"1878" data-end=3D"1906">Critical Section Problem</strong> m=
ust satisfy these <strong data-start=3D"1926" data-end=3D"1946">three condi=
tions</strong>:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"1949" data-end=3D"2590">
<li data-start=3D"1949" data-end=3D"2120">
<p data-start=3D"1952" data-end=3D"1975"><strong data-start=3D"1952" data-e=
nd=3D"1973">Mutual Exclusion:</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1979" data-end=3D"2120">
<li data-start=3D"1979" data-end=3D"2050">
<p data-start=3D"1981" data-end=3D"2050"><strong data-start=3D"1981" data-e=
nd=3D"2001">Only one process</strong> can execute in the critical section a=
t a time.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2054" data-end=3D"2120">
<p data-start=3D"2056" data-end=3D"2120">If one process is in its critical =
section, others must <strong data-start=3D"2111" data-end=3D"2119">wait</st=
rong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2122" data-end=3D"2381">
<p data-start=3D"2125" data-end=3D"2140"><strong data-start=3D"2125" data-e=
nd=3D"2138">Progress:</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2144" data-end=3D"2381">
<li data-start=3D"2144" data-end=3D"2323">
<p data-start=3D"2146" data-end=3D"2323">If <strong data-start=3D"2149" dat=
a-end=3D"2163">no process</strong> is in its critical section and some proc=
esses want to enter, then only those processes <strong data-start=3D"2251" =
data-end=3D"2286">not in their remainder sections</strong> should <strong d=
ata-start=3D"2294" data-end=3D"2320">decide who enters next</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2327" data-end=3D"2381">
<p data-start=3D"2329" data-end=3D"2381">The decision must <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"2347" data-end=3D"2380">not be postponed indefinitely</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2383" data-end=3D"2590">
<p data-start=3D"2386" data-end=3D"2408"><strong data-start=3D"2386" data-e=
nd=3D"2406">Bounded Waiting:</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2412" data-end=3D"2590">
<li data-start=3D"2412" data-end=3D"2555">
<p data-start=3D"2414" data-end=3D"2555">There must be a <strong data-start=
=3D"2430" data-end=3D"2483">limit on how many times other processes can ent=
er</strong> their critical sections <strong data-start=3D"2508" data-end=3D=
"2552">before a waiting process gets its chance</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2559" data-end=3D"2590">
<p data-start=3D"2561" data-end=3D"2590">This prevents <strong data-start=
=3D"2575" data-end=3D"2589">starvation</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"2592" data-end=3D"2595">
<h3 data-start=3D"2597" data-end=3D"2634">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"2=
603" data-end=3D"2634">Summary for Writing in Exam</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2636" data-end=3D"2968">
<li data-start=3D"2636" data-end=3D"2708">
<p data-start=3D"2638" data-end=3D"2708">Critical Section Problem arises in=
 <strong data-start=3D"2673" data-end=3D"2705">concurrent process execution=
</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2709" data-end=3D"2811">
<p data-start=3D"2711" data-end=3D"2811">Goal is to <strong data-start=3D"2=
722" data-end=3D"2750">avoid data inconsistency</strong> by ensuring <stron=
g data-start=3D"2763" data-end=3D"2780">one-at-a-time</strong> access to cr=
itical sections.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2812" data-end=3D"2879">
<p data-start=3D"2814" data-end=3D"2879">Divided into <strong data-start=3D=
"2827" data-end=3D"2867">Entry, Critical, Exit, and Remainder</strong> sect=
ions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2880" data-end=3D"2968">
<p data-start=3D"2882" data-end=3D"2968">Any solution must satisfy <strong =
data-start=3D"2908" data-end=3D"2928">Mutual Exclusion</strong>, <strong da=
ta-start=3D"2930" data-end=3D"2942">Progress</strong>, and <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"2948" data-end=3D"2967">Bounded Waiting</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
