</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"1543" data-end=3D"1546">
<h2 data-start=3D"1548" data-end=3D"1574">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"1=
553" data-end=3D"1574">Correctness Proof</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1576" data-end=3D"1603"><strong data-start=3D"1580" data-=
end=3D"1603">1. Mutual Exclusion</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1605" data-end=3D"2199">
<li data-start=3D"1605" data-end=3D"1777">
<p data-start=3D"1607" data-end=3D"1777">A process <strong data-start=3D"16=
17" data-end=3D"1630">enters CS</strong> only if:<br data-start=3D"1639" da=
ta-end=3D"1642">
<code data-start=3D"1644" data-end=3D"1674">while (flag[j] &amp;&amp; turn =
=3D=3D j)</code> becomes <strong data-start=3D"1683" data-end=3D"1692">fals=
e</strong> =E2=86=92 either <code data-start=3D"1702" data-end=3D"1720">fla=
g[j] =3D=3D false</code> (other is not interested) OR <code data-start=3D"1=
750" data-end=3D"1761">turn =3D=3D i</code> (it's my turn).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1779" data-end=3D"1980">
<p data-start=3D"1781" data-end=3D"1836">Suppose <strong data-start=3D"1789=
" data-end=3D"1802">P=E2=82=80 and P=E2=82=81</strong> both try to enter si=
multaneously:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"1839" data-end=3D"1980">
<li data-start=3D"1839" data-end=3D"1880">
<p data-start=3D"1842" data-end=3D"1880">P=E2=82=80 sets <code data-start=
=3D"1850" data-end=3D"1866">flag[0] =3D true</code>, <code data-start=3D"18=
68" data-end=3D"1878">turn =3D 1</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1883" data-end=3D"1924">
<p data-start=3D"1886" data-end=3D"1924">P=E2=82=81 sets <code data-start=
=3D"1894" data-end=3D"1910">flag[1] =3D true</code>, <code data-start=3D"19=
12" data-end=3D"1922">turn =3D 0</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1927" data-end=3D"1980">
<p data-start=3D"1930" data-end=3D"1980">One write to <code data-start=3D"1=
943" data-end=3D"1949">turn</code> happens last (say <code data-start=3D"19=
68" data-end=3D"1978">turn =3D 1</code>).</p>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1982" data-end=3D"2112">
<p data-start=3D"1984" data-end=3D"2004">Check while loops:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2007" data-end=3D"2112">
<li data-start=3D"2007" data-end=3D"2052">
<p data-start=3D"2009" data-end=3D"2052">P=E2=82=80: <code data-start=3D"20=
13" data-end=3D"2042">while(flag[1] &amp;&amp; turn =3D=3D 1)</code> =E2=86=
=92 waits</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2055" data-end=3D"2112">
<p data-start=3D"2057" data-end=3D"2112">P=E2=82=81: <code data-start=3D"20=
61" data-end=3D"2090">while(flag[0] &amp;&amp; turn =3D=3D 0)</code> =E2=86=
=92 false =E2=86=92 enters CS =E2=9C=85</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2114" data-end=3D"2199">
<p data-start=3D"2116" data-end=3D"2199">So, <strong data-start=3D"2120" da=
ta-end=3D"2160">only one process enters CS at a time</strong>.<br data-star=
t=3D"2161" data-end=3D"2164">
=E2=87=92 <strong data-start=3D"2168" data-end=3D"2199">Mutual Exclusion sa=
tisfied.</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2201" data-end=3D"2204">
<h3 data-start=3D"2206" data-end=3D"2225"><strong data-start=3D"2210" data-=
end=3D"2225">2. Progress</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2227" data-end=3D"2598">
<li data-start=3D"2227" data-end=3D"2315">
<p data-start=3D"2229" data-end=3D"2315"><strong data-start=3D"2229" data-e=
nd=3D"2240">Case 1:</strong> If <strong data-start=3D"2244" data-end=3D"226=
8">Pj is not interested</strong> (flag[j] =3D false), Pi enters CS immediat=
ely.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2316" data-end=3D"2433">
<p data-start=3D"2318" data-end=3D"2354"><strong data-start=3D"2318" data-e=
nd=3D"2329">Case 2:</strong> If both want to enter:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2357" data-end=3D"2433">
<li data-start=3D"2357" data-end=3D"2402">
<p data-start=3D"2359" data-end=3D"2402">Whoever <strong data-start=3D"2367=
" data-end=3D"2393">does not have the turn</strong> waits.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2405" data-end=3D"2433">
<p data-start=3D"2407" data-end=3D"2433">The other <strong data-start=3D"24=
17" data-end=3D"2427">enters</strong> CS.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2434" data-end=3D"2598">
<p data-start=3D"2436" data-end=3D"2598">Once the critical section is free,=
 <strong data-start=3D"2471" data-end=3D"2503">one of the waiting processes=
</strong> will enter based on turn value =E2=80=94 <strong data-start=3D"25=
37" data-end=3D"2567">no indefinite postponement</strong>.<br data-start=3D=
"2568" data-end=3D"2571">
=E2=87=92 <strong data-start=3D"2575" data-end=3D"2598">Progress satisfied.=
</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2600" data-end=3D"2603">
<h3 data-start=3D"2605" data-end=3D"2631"><strong data-start=3D"2609" data-=
end=3D"2631">3. Bounded Waiting</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2633" data-end=3D"2948">
<li data-start=3D"2633" data-end=3D"2679">
<p data-start=3D"2635" data-end=3D"2679">Suppose Pi is waiting because <cod=
e data-start=3D"2665" data-end=3D"2676">turn =3D=3D j</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2680" data-end=3D"2728">
<p data-start=3D"2682" data-end=3D"2728">Once Pj exits CS, it sets <code da=
ta-start=3D"2708" data-end=3D"2725">flag[j] =3D false</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2729" data-end=3D"2750">
<p data-start=3D"2731" data-end=3D"2750">Now Pi enters CS.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2751" data-end=3D"2843">
<p data-start=3D"2753" data-end=3D"2843">Even if Pj immediately wants to re=
-enter, it <strong data-start=3D"2798" data-end=3D"2815">sets turn =3D i</s=
trong>, giving Pi the next turn.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2844" data-end=3D"2948">
<p data-start=3D"2846" data-end=3D"2948">So, <strong data-start=3D"2850" da=
ta-end=3D"2889">each process waits at most one turn</strong> of the other p=
rocess.<br data-start=3D"2911" data-end=3D"2914">
=E2=87=92 <strong data-start=3D"2918" data-end=3D"2948">Bounded Waiting sat=
isfied.</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
