<hr data-start=3D"3350" data-end=3D"3353">
<h2 data-start=3D"3355" data-end=3D"3404">=E2=9C=8D=EF=B8=8F <strong data-s=
tart=3D"3361" data-end=3D"3404">Short 5=E2=80=938 Marks Version (Quick Writ=
ing)</strong></h2>
<blockquote data-start=3D"3406" data-end=3D"4180">
<p data-start=3D"3408" data-end=3D"3925"><strong data-start=3D"3408" data-e=
nd=3D"3431">Peterson=E2=80=99s Solution</strong> is a classic <strong data-=
start=3D"3445" data-end=3D"3484">software solution for two processes</stron=
g> to solve the <strong data-start=3D"3498" data-end=3D"3526">Critical Sect=
ion Problem</strong>.<br data-start=3D"3527" data-end=3D"3530">
It uses two shared variables =E2=80=94 <strong data-start=3D"3563" data-end=
=3D"3576"><code data-start=3D"3565" data-end=3D"3574">flag[2]</code></stron=
g> (indicates interest) and <strong data-start=3D"3602" data-end=3D"3612"><=
code data-start=3D"3604" data-end=3D"3610">turn</code></strong> (indicates =
whose turn it is) =E2=80=94 to control entry into the critical section.<br =
data-start=3D"3687" data-end=3D"3690">
Each process sets its flag true and gives turn to the other process. It the=
n waits while the other process is interested and has the turn.<br data-sta=
rt=3D"3830" data-end=3D"3833">
Peterson=E2=80=99s solution satisfies <strong data-start=3D"3865" data-end=
=3D"3885">Mutual Exclusion</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"3887" data-end=
=3D"3899">Progress</strong>, and <strong data-start=3D"3905" data-end=3D"39=
24">Bounded Waiting</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3928" data-end=3D"4180">
<li data-start=3D"3928" data-end=3D"4019">
<p data-start=3D"3930" data-end=3D"4019"><strong data-start=3D"3930" data-e=
nd=3D"3951">Mutual Exclusion:</strong> Turn can only be one value at a time=
, so only one process enters.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4022" data-end=3D"4103">
<p data-start=3D"4024" data-end=3D"4103"><strong data-start=3D"4024" data-e=
nd=3D"4037">Progress:</strong> If the other is not interested, the process =
enters immediately.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4106" data-end=3D"4180">
<p data-start=3D"4108" data-end=3D"4180"><strong data-start=3D"4108" data-e=
nd=3D"4128">Bounded Waiting:</strong> Each process waits at most one turn o=
f the other.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
