<li data-start=3D"998" data-end=3D"1233">
<p data-start=3D"1000" data-end=3D"1053"><code data-start=3D"1000" data-end=
=3D"1016">test_and_set()</code> performs <strong data-start=3D"1026" data-e=
nd=3D"1052">two actions atomically</strong>:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"1056" data-end=3D"1233">
<li data-start=3D"1056" data-end=3D"1134">
<p data-start=3D"1059" data-end=3D"1134"><strong data-start=3D"1059" data-e=
nd=3D"1068">Reads</strong> the current value of a memory location (e.g., a =
lock variable).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1137" data-end=3D"1201">
<p data-start=3D"1140" data-end=3D"1201"><strong data-start=3D"1140" data-e=
nd=3D"1148">Sets</strong> that memory location to <code data-start=3D"1173"=
 data-end=3D"1176">1</code> (indicating =E2=80=9Clocked=E2=80=9D).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1204" data-end=3D"1233">
<p data-start=3D"1207" data-end=3D"1233">Returns the <strong data-start=3D"=
