<hr data-start=3D"1829" data-end=3D"1832">
<h3 data-start=3D"1834" data-end=3D"1875">=E2=9C=A8 <strong data-start=3D"1=
840" data-end=3D"1875">Why Mutual Exclusion is Ensured</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1877" data-end=3D"2241">
<li data-start=3D"1877" data-end=3D"2115">
<p data-start=3D"1879" data-end=3D"1951">Suppose <strong data-start=3D"1887=
" data-end=3D"1904">two processes</strong> call <code data-start=3D"1910" d=
ata-end=3D"1931">test_and_set(&amp;lock)</code> <strong data-start=3D"1932"=
 data-end=3D"1950">simultaneously</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1954" data-end=3D"2115">
<li data-start=3D"1954" data-end=3D"2039">
<p data-start=3D"1956" data-end=3D"2039">Only <strong data-start=3D"1961" d=
ata-end=3D"1968">one</strong> process will <strong data-start=3D"1982" data=
-end=3D"2004">see <code data-start=3D"1988" data-end=3D"2002">lock =3D fals=
e</code></strong>, set it to true, and <strong data-start=3D"2026" data-end=
=3D"2038">enter CS</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2042" data-end=3D"2115">
<p data-start=3D"2044" data-end=3D"2115">All <strong data-start=3D"2048" da=
ta-end=3D"2058">others</strong> will see <code data-start=3D"2068" data-end=
=3D"2081">lock =3D true</code> and <strong data-start=3D"2086" data-end=3D"=
2094">wait</strong> in the <code data-start=3D"2102" data-end=3D"2109">whil=
e</code> loop.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2116" data-end=3D"2241">
<p data-start=3D"2118" data-end=3D"2241">Because <code data-start=3D"2126" =
data-end=3D"2142">test_and_set()</code> is <strong data-start=3D"2146" data=
-end=3D"2156">atomic</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"2158" data-end=3D"2200=
">no two processes can enter CS together</strong>.<br data-start=3D"2201" d=
ata-end=3D"2204">
=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"2206" data-end=3D"2240">Mutual Exclusion is=
 guaranteed</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2243" data-end=3D"2246">
<h3 data-start=3D"2248" data-end=3D"2268">=E2=9A=A1 <strong data-start=3D"2=
254" data-end=3D"2268">Advantages</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2270" data-end=3D"2401">
<li data-start=3D"2270" data-end=3D"2313">
<p data-start=3D"2272" data-end=3D"2313"><strong data-start=3D"2272" data-e=
nd=3D"2282">Simple</strong> to implement mutual exclusion.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2314" data-end=3D"2359">
<p data-start=3D"2316" data-end=3D"2359">Works on <strong data-start=3D"232=
5" data-end=3D"2358">modern multiprocessor systems</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2360" data-end=3D"2401">
<p data-start=3D"2362" data-end=3D"2401">No need for complex software proto=
cols.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2403" data-end=3D"2406">
<h3 data-start=3D"2408" data-end=3D"2428">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F <strong data-s=
tart=3D"2415" data-end=3D"2428">Drawbacks</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2430" data-end=3D"2637">
<li data-start=3D"2430" data-end=3D"2489">
<p data-start=3D"2432" data-end=3D"2489">Involves <strong data-start=3D"244=
1" data-end=3D"2457">busy waiting</strong> (spinning), wasting CPU time.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2490" data-end=3D"2543">
<p data-start=3D"2492" data-end=3D"2543">Does <strong data-start=3D"2497" d=
ata-end=3D"2530">not guarantee bounded waiting</strong> by itself.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2544" data-end=3D"2637">
<p data-start=3D"2546" data-end=3D"2637">Can lead to <strong data-start=3D"=
2558" data-end=3D"2580">priority inversion</strong> or <strong data-start=
=3D"2584" data-end=3D"2598">starvation</strong> if not combined with other =
mechanisms.</p>
</li>
</ul>
