<hr data-start=3D"3515" data-end=3D"3518">
<h2 data-start=3D"3520" data-end=3D"3569">=E2=9C=8D=EF=B8=8F <strong data-s=
tart=3D"3526" data-end=3D"3569">Short 5=E2=80=938 Marks Version (Quick Writ=
ing)</strong></h2>
<blockquote data-start=3D"3571" data-end=3D"4154">
<p data-start=3D"3573" data-end=3D"4154"><strong data-start=3D"3573" data-e=
nd=3D"3613">Hardware Support for Synchronization</strong> uses <strong data=
-start=3D"3619" data-end=3D"3642">atomic instructions</strong> provided by =
the CPU to implement <strong data-start=3D"3676" data-end=3D"3696">mutual e=
xclusion</strong> efficiently.<br data-start=3D"3709" data-end=3D"3712">
One such instruction is <strong data-start=3D"3738" data-end=3D"3758"><code=
 data-start=3D"3740" data-end=3D"3756">test_and_set()</code></strong>, whic=
h <strong data-start=3D"3766" data-end=3D"3811">atomically reads and sets a=
 lock variable</strong> and returns its old value.<br data-start=3D"3838" d=
ata-end=3D"3841">
If two processes use <code data-start=3D"3864" data-end=3D"3880">test_and_s=
et()</code> simultaneously, only one will find the lock as false and enter =
the critical section, while the others spin.<br data-start=3D"3988" data-en=
d=3D"3991">
This ensures <strong data-start=3D"4006" data-end=3D"4026">mutual exclusion=
</strong> without complex software protocols.<br data-start=3D"4062" data-e=
nd=3D"4065">
However, it involves <strong data-start=3D"4088" data-end=3D"4104">busy wai=
ting</strong> and does not guarantee bounded waiting by itself.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"4156" data-end=3D"4159">
<p data-start=3D"4161" data-end=3D"4187">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"41=
63" data-end=3D"4185">Keywords for exam:</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"4188" data-end=3D"4292">
<li data-start=3D"4188" data-end=3D"4210">
<p data-start=3D"4190" data-end=3D"4210">Atomic instruction</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4211" data-end=3D"4227">
<p data-start=3D"4213" data-end=3D"4227">test_and_set</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4228" data-end=3D"4245">
<p data-start=3D"4230" data-end=3D"4245">Lock variable</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4246" data-end=3D"4266">
<p data-start=3D"4248" data-end=3D"4266">Mutual exclusion</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4267" data-end=3D"4292">
<p data-start=3D"4269" data-end=3D"4292">Busy waiting / spinlock</p>
</li>
</ul>
