<hr data-start=3D"1302" data-end=3D"1305">
<h2 data-start=3D"1307" data-end=3D"1333">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"1=
312" data-end=3D"1333">Correctness Proof</strong></h2>
<hr data-start=3D"1335" data-end=3D"1338">
<h3 data-start=3D"1340" data-end=3D"1367"><strong data-start=3D"1344" data-=
end=3D"1367">1. Mutual Exclusion</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1369" data-end=3D"1791">
<li data-start=3D"1369" data-end=3D"1404">
<p data-start=3D"1371" data-end=3D"1404">Initially, <code data-start=3D"138=
2" data-end=3D"1392">lock =3D 0</code> (unlocked).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1405" data-end=3D"1664">
<p data-start=3D"1407" data-end=3D"1483">When multiple processes call <code=
 data-start=3D"1436" data-end=3D"1467">compare_and_swap(&amp;lock, 0, 1)</c=
ode> simultaneously:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1486" data-end=3D"1664">
<li data-start=3D"1486" data-end=3D"1554">
<p data-start=3D"1488" data-end=3D"1554">Only <strong data-start=3D"1493" d=
ata-end=3D"1508">one process</strong> will find <code data-start=3D"1519" d=
ata-end=3D"1530">lock =3D=3D 0</code>, and <strong data-start=3D"1536" data=
-end=3D"1551">set it to 1</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1557" data-end=3D"1664">
<p data-start=3D"1559" data-end=3D"1664">All <strong data-start=3D"1563" da=
ta-end=3D"1582">other processes</strong> will find <code data-start=3D"1593=
" data-end=3D"1604">lock !=3D 0</code> and <strong data-start=3D"1609" data=
-end=3D"1626">fail the swap</strong>, remaining stuck in the <code data-sta=
rt=3D"1651" data-end=3D"1658">while</code> loop.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1665" data-end=3D"1791">
<p data-start=3D"1667" data-end=3D"1791">Since <code data-start=3D"1673" da=
ta-end=3D"1693">compare_and_swap()</code> is <strong data-start=3D"1697" da=
ta-end=3D"1707">atomic</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"1709" data-end=3D"17=
29">no two processes</strong> can successfully change the lock from 0 =E2=
=86=92 1 at the same time.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1793" data-end=3D"1914">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"17=
95" data-end=3D"1806">Result:</strong><br data-start=3D"1806" data-end=3D"1=
809">
Only <strong data-start=3D"1814" data-end=3D"1829">one process</strong> can=
 enter the <strong data-start=3D"1844" data-end=3D"1864">critical section</=
strong> at a time.<br data-start=3D"1875" data-end=3D"1878">
=E2=87=92 <strong data-start=3D"1880" data-end=3D"1914">Mutual Exclusion is=
 satisfied.</strong></p>
<hr data-start=3D"1916" data-end=3D"1919">
<h3 data-start=3D"1921" data-end=3D"1940"><strong data-start=3D"1925" data-=
end=3D"1940">2. Progress</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1942" data-end=3D"2272">
<li data-start=3D"1942" data-end=3D"2003">
<p data-start=3D"1944" data-end=3D"2003">If <strong data-start=3D"1947" dat=
a-end=3D"1988">no process is in its critical section</strong>, <code data-s=
tart=3D"1990" data-end=3D"2000">lock =3D 0</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2004" data-end=3D"2108">
<p data-start=3D"2006" data-end=3D"2108">Any process that executes <code da=
ta-start=3D"2032" data-end=3D"2063">compare_and_swap(&amp;lock, 0, 1)</code=
> will <strong data-start=3D"2069" data-end=3D"2092">succeed immediately</s=
trong> and enter CS.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2109" data-end=3D"2206">
<p data-start=3D"2111" data-end=3D"2206">If multiple processes try simultan=
eously, <strong data-start=3D"2153" data-end=3D"2181">one of them will succ=
eed</strong>; the others will wait.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2207" data-end=3D"2272">
<p data-start=3D"2209" data-end=3D"2272">If no process is interested, no on=
e blocks progress for others.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2274" data-end=3D"2435">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"22=
76" data-end=3D"2287">Result:</strong><br data-start=3D"2287" data-end=3D"2=
290">
If the critical section is free and some processes wish to enter, <strong d=
ata-start=3D"2356" data-end=3D"2403">someone will enter without indefinite =
delay</strong>.<br data-start=3D"2404" data-end=3D"2407">
=E2=87=92 <strong data-start=3D"2409" data-end=3D"2435">Progress is satisfi=
ed.</strong></p>
<hr data-start=3D"2437" data-end=3D"2440">
<h3 data-start=3D"2442" data-end=3D"2468"><strong data-start=3D"2446" data-=
end=3D"2468">3. Bounded Waiting</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2470" data-end=3D"2751">
<li data-start=3D"2470" data-end=3D"2567">
<p data-start=3D"2472" data-end=3D"2567">Like <code data-start=3D"2477" dat=
a-end=3D"2493">test_and_set()</code>, <code data-start=3D"2495" data-end=3D=
"2515">compare_and_swap()</code> <strong data-start=3D"2516" data-end=3D"25=
54">does not guarantee bounded waiting</strong> by itself.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2568" data-end=3D"2693">
<p data-start=3D"2570" data-end=3D"2693">A process might <strong data-start=
=3D"2586" data-end=3D"2607">continuously lose</strong> in the race to swap =
the lock variable due to <strong data-start=3D"2653" data-end=3D"2667">sche=
duling</strong> or <strong data-start=3D"2671" data-end=3D"2683">priority</=
strong> issues.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2694" data-end=3D"2751">
<p data-start=3D"2696" data-end=3D"2751">There is <strong data-start=3D"270=
5" data-end=3D"2729">no built-in ordering</strong> of waiting processes.</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2753" data-end=3D"2885">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"27=
55" data-end=3D"2766">Result:</strong><br data-start=3D"2766" data-end=3D"2=
769">
A process may wait indefinitely if unlucky.<br data-start=3D"2812" data-end=
=3D"2815">
=E2=87=92 <strong data-start=3D"2817" data-end=3D"2854">Bounded Waiting is =
not guaranteed</strong> with compare_and_swap() alone.</p>
