<hr data-start=3D"3195" data-end=3D"3198">
<h3 data-start=3D"3200" data-end=3D"3249">=E2=9C=8D=EF=B8=8F <strong data-s=
tart=3D"3207" data-end=3D"3249">Short 5=E2=80=938 Mark Version (Quick Writi=
ng)</strong></h3>
<blockquote data-start=3D"3251" data-end=3D"3712">
<p data-start=3D"3253" data-end=3D"3712">The <strong data-start=3D"3257" da=
ta-end=3D"3281"><code data-start=3D"3259" data-end=3D"3279">compare_and_swa=
p()</code></strong> instruction performs an <strong data-start=3D"3306" dat=
a-end=3D"3345">atomic compare and conditional swap</strong> operation.<br d=
ata-start=3D"3356" data-end=3D"3359">
It can be used to implement mutual exclusion using a <strong data-start=3D"=
3414" data-end=3D"3438">shared lock variable</strong>.<br data-start=3D"343=
9" data-end=3D"3442">
Only one process can successfully change <code data-start=3D"3485" data-end=
=3D"3491">lock</code> from 0 =E2=86=92 1; others spin until it is released.=
<br data-start=3D"3537" data-end=3D"3540">
This ensures <strong data-start=3D"3555" data-end=3D"3575">mutual exclusion=
</strong> and <strong data-start=3D"3580" data-end=3D"3592">progress</stron=
g>.<br data-start=3D"3593" data-end=3D"3596">
However, like <code data-start=3D"3612" data-end=3D"3628">test_and_set()</c=
ode>, it involves <strong data-start=3D"3642" data-end=3D"3658">busy waitin=
g</strong> and <strong data-start=3D"3663" data-end=3D"3701">does not guara=
ntee bounded waiting</strong> by itself.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"3714" data-end=3D"3717">
<p data-start=3D"3719" data-end=3D"3745">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"37=
21" data-end=3D"3743">Keywords for exam:</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3746" data-end=3D"3861">
<li data-start=3D"3746" data-end=3D"3768">
<p data-start=3D"3748" data-end=3D"3768">Atomic instruction</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3769" data-end=3D"3786">
<p data-start=3D"3771" data-end=3D"3786">compare, swap</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3787" data-end=3D"3809">
<p data-start=3D"3789" data-end=3D"3809">Mutual Exclusion =E2=9C=94</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3810" data-end=3D"3824">
<p data-start=3D"3812" data-end=3D"3824">Progress =E2=9C=94</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3825" data-end=3D"3846">
<p data-start=3D"3827" data-end=3D"3846">Bounded Waiting =E2=9D=8C</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3847" data-end=3D"3861">
<p data-start=3D"3849" data-end=3D"3861">Busy waiting</p>
</li>
</ul>
