<li data-start=3D"472" data-end=3D"633">
<p data-start=3D"474" data-end=3D"633">It helps to <strong data-start=3D"48=
6" data-end=3D"511">avoid race conditions</strong>, i.e., situations where =
multiple processes try to access and modify shared data simultaneously, lea=
ding to inconsistency.</p>
</li>
