<h2 data-start=3D"1930" data-end=3D"1959">=F0=9F=9F=A1 <strong data-start=
=3D"1936" data-end=3D"1959">Types of Semaphores</strong></h2>
<ol data-start=3D"1961" data-end=3D"2299">
<li data-start=3D"1961" data-end=3D"2123">
<p data-start=3D"1964" data-end=3D"1994"><strong data-start=3D"1964" data-e=
nd=3D"1992">Binary Semaphore (Mutex)</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1998" data-end=3D"2123">
<li data-start=3D"1998" data-end=3D"2034">
<p data-start=3D"2000" data-end=3D"2034">Can take values <strong data-start=
=3D"2016" data-end=3D"2026">0 or 1</strong> only.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2038" data-end=3D"2081">
<p data-start=3D"2040" data-end=3D"2081">Works like a <strong data-start=3D=
"2053" data-end=3D"2068">lock/unlock</strong> mechanism.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2085" data-end=3D"2123">
<p data-start=3D"2087" data-end=3D"2123">Used to ensure <strong data-start=
=3D"2102" data-end=3D"2122">mutual exclusion</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2125" data-end=3D"2299">
<p data-start=3D"2128" data-end=3D"2152"><strong data-start=3D"2128" data-e=
nd=3D"2150">Counting Semaphore</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2156" data-end=3D"2299">
<li data-start=3D"2156" data-end=3D"2204">
<p data-start=3D"2158" data-end=3D"2204">Can take any <strong data-start=3D=
"2171" data-end=3D"2201">non-negative integer value</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2208" data-end=3D"2299">
<p data-start=3D"2210" data-end=3D"2299">Used to control <strong data-start=
=3D"2226" data-end=3D"2258">access to multiple instances</strong> of a reso=
urce (e.g., multiple printers).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
