=3D"1751" data-end=3D"1774">Usage of Semaphores</strong></h2>
<ol data-start=3D"1776" data-end=3D"2050">
<li data-start=3D"1776" data-end=3D"1839">
<p data-start=3D"1779" data-end=3D"1839">Initialize semaphore to <strong da=
