<p data-start=3D"4409" data-end=3D"4426">Types (2 marks)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4427" data-end=3D"4474">
<p data-start=3D"4429" data-end=3D"4474">Busy waiting + non-busy waiting (3=
