If you understand the <strong data-start=3D"147" data-end=3D"193">Bounded B=
uffer (Producer=E2=80=93Consumer) Problem</strong> deeply, you can easily a=
ttempt <strong data-start=3D"225" data-end=3D"261">any scenario-based exam =
question</strong> on it.<br data-start=3D"268" data-end=3D"271">
Let me explain it step by step with <strong data-start=3D"307" data-end=3D"=
370">concept =E2=86=92 semaphores =E2=86=92 working =E2=86=92 process flows=
 =E2=86=92 variations</strong> =F0=9F=91=87</p>
<hr data-start=3D"375" data-end=3D"378">
<h1 data-start=3D"380" data-end=3D"431">=F0=9F=9F=A1 The Bounded-Buffer (Pr=
oducer=E2=80=93Consumer) Problem</h1>
<h3 data-start=3D"433" data-end=3D"454"><strong data-start=3D"437" data-end=
=3D"454">Problem Setup</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"455" data-end=3D"679">
<li data-start=3D"455" data-end=3D"506">
<p data-start=3D"457" data-end=3D"506">We have a <strong data-start=3D"467"=
 data-end=3D"484">shared buffer</strong> of finite size <code data-start=3D=
"500" data-end=3D"503">N</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"507" data-end=3D"608">
<p data-start=3D"509" data-end=3D"608"><strong data-start=3D"509" data-end=
=3D"521">Producer</strong>: generates data items (e.g., messages, files, jo=
bs) and places them into the buffer.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"609" data-end=3D"679">
<p data-start=3D"611" data-end=3D"679"><strong data-start=3D"611" data-end=
=3D"623">Consumer</strong>: takes data items from the buffer and processes =
them.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"681" data-end=3D"700">=F0=9F=91=89 <strong data-start=3D"6=
84" data-end=3D"700">Constraints:</strong></p>
<ol data-start=3D"701" data-end=3D"927">
<li data-start=3D"701" data-end=3D"759">
<p data-start=3D"704" data-end=3D"759">Producer <strong data-start=3D"713" =
data-end=3D"730">cannot insert</strong> if the buffer is <strong data-start=
=3D"748" data-end=3D"756">full</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"760" data-end=3D"819">
<p data-start=3D"763" data-end=3D"819">Consumer <strong data-start=3D"772" =
data-end=3D"789">cannot remove</strong> if the buffer is <strong data-start=
=3D"807" data-end=3D"816">empty</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"820" data-end=3D"927">
<p data-start=3D"823" data-end=3D"927"><strong data-start=3D"823" data-end=
=3D"843">Mutual exclusion</strong> is required, so Producer and Consumer do=
n=E2=80=99t modify the buffer <strong data-start=3D"906" data-end=3D"926">a=
t the same time</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"929" data-end=3D"932">
<h1 data-start=3D"934" data-end=3D"968">=F0=9F=9F=A1 Solution using <strong=
 data-start=3D"954" data-end=3D"968">Semaphores</strong></h1>
<p data-start=3D"970" data-end=3D"998">We use <strong data-start=3D"977" da=
ta-end=3D"997">three semaphores</strong>:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"1000" data-end=3D"1468">
<li data-start=3D"1000" data-end=3D"1120">
<p data-start=3D"1003" data-end=3D"1039"><strong data-start=3D"1003" data-e=
nd=3D"1037"><code data-start=3D"1005" data-end=3D"1012">mutex</code> (Binar=
y Semaphore =3D 1)</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1043" data-end=3D"1120">
<li data-start=3D"1043" data-end=3D"1120">
<p data-start=3D"1045" data-end=3D"1120">Controls mutual exclusion (only on=
e process can update buffer at a time).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1122" data-end=3D"1300">
<p data-start=3D"1125" data-end=3D"1163"><strong data-start=3D"1125" data-e=
nd=3D"1161"><code data-start=3D"1127" data-end=3D"1134">empty</code> (Count=
ing Semaphore =3D N)</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1167" data-end=3D"1300">
<li data-start=3D"1167" data-end=3D"1236">
<p data-start=3D"1169" data-end=3D"1236">Represents the number of <strong d=
ata-start=3D"1194" data-end=3D"1209">empty slots</strong> available in the =
buffer.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1240" data-end=3D"1300">
<p data-start=3D"1242" data-end=3D"1300">Initialized to <code data-start=3D=
"1257" data-end=3D"1260">N</code> (buffer has N empty slots initially).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1302" data-end=3D"1468">
<p data-start=3D"1305" data-end=3D"1342"><strong data-start=3D"1305" data-e=
nd=3D"1340"><code data-start=3D"1307" data-end=3D"1313">full</code> (Counti=
ng Semaphore =3D 0)</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1346" data-end=3D"1468">
<li data-start=3D"1346" data-end=3D"1406">
<p data-start=3D"1348" data-end=3D"1406">Represents the number of <strong d=
ata-start=3D"1373" data-end=3D"1389">filled slots</strong> in the buffer.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1410" data-end=3D"1468">
<p data-start=3D"1412" data-end=3D"1468">Initialized to <code data-start=3D=
"1427" data-end=3D"1430">0</code> (buffer is empty at the beginning).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
