<li data-start=3D"4662" data-end=3D"4695">
<p data-start=3D"4664" data-end=3D"4695">Problem statement (2=E2=80=933 lin=
es)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4696" data-end=3D"4711">
<p data-start=3D"4698" data-end=3D"4711">Constraints</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4712" data-end=3D"4754">
<p data-start=3D"4714" data-end=3D"4754">Semaphore definitions + initializa=
tion</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4755" data-end=3D"4806">
<p data-start=3D"4757" data-end=3D"4806">Producer + Consumer pseudocode wit=
h explanation</p>
</li>
</ul>
