process structures =E2=86=92 logic =E2=86=92 variations</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"220" data-end=3D"223">
<h1 data-start=3D"225" data-end=3D"257">=F0=9F=9F=A1 The Readers-Writers Pr=
oblem</h1>
<h3 data-start=3D"259" data-end=3D"284"><strong data-start=3D"263" data-end=
=3D"284">Problem Statement</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"285" data-end=3D"493">
<li data-start=3D"285" data-end=3D"493">
<p data-start=3D"287" data-end=3D"360">A <strong data-start=3D"289" data-en=
d=3D"308">shared database</strong> is accessed by <strong data-start=3D"324=
" data-end=3D"357">multiple concurrent processes</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"363" data-end=3D"493">
<li data-start=3D"363" data-end=3D"419">
<p data-start=3D"365" data-end=3D"419"><strong data-start=3D"365" data-end=
=3D"376">Readers</strong> =E2=86=92 only <strong data-start=3D"384" data-en=
d=3D"392">read</strong> data; do <strong data-start=3D"402" data-end=3D"416=
">not modify</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"422" data-end=3D"493">
<p data-start=3D"424" data-end=3D"493"><strong data-start=3D"424" data-end=
=3D"435">Writers</strong> =E2=86=92 <strong data-start=3D"438" data-end=3D"=
455">update/modify</strong> data; require <strong data-start=3D"470" data-e=
nd=3D"490">exclusive access</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"495" data-end=3D"514"><strong data-start=3D"499" data-end=
=3D"514">Constraints</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"515" data-end=3D"738">
<li data-start=3D"515" data-end=3D"606">
<p data-start=3D"518" data-end=3D"606"><strong data-start=3D"518" data-end=
=3D"554">Writers require exclusive access</strong> =E2=86=92 no readers or =
writers can access while writing.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"607" data-end=3D"683">
<p data-start=3D"610" data-end=3D"683"><strong data-start=3D"610" data-end=
=3D"654">Multiple readers can read simultaneously</strong> =E2=86=92 if no =
writer is writing.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"684" data-end=3D"738">
<p data-start=3D"687" data-end=3D"738">If a <strong data-start=3D"692" data=
-end=3D"713">writer is writing</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"715" data-en=
d=3D"737">no reader can read</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"740" data-end=3D"743">
