<h3 data-start=3D"1373" data-end=3D"1392">=F0=9F=94=8E Explanation:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1393" data-end=3D"1520">
<li data-start=3D"1393" data-end=3D"1473">
<p data-start=3D"1395" data-end=3D"1473">Writer locks <code data-start=3D"1=
408" data-end=3D"1418">rw_mutex</code> =E2=86=92 <strong data-start=3D"1421=
" data-end=3D"1450">no reader or other writer</strong> can access database.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1474" data-end=3D"1520">
<p data-start=3D"1476" data-end=3D"1520">After writing, writer releases <co=
de data-start=3D"1507" data-end=3D"1517">rw_mutex</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1522" data-end=3D"1565">=E2=9C=85 Ensures <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"1532" data-end=3D"1552">exclusive access</strong> for writers.</p>
