<h3 data-start=3D"1967" data-end=3D"1986">=F0=9F=94=8E Explanation:</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"1988" data-end=3D"2711">
<li data-start=3D"1988" data-end=3D"2082">
<p data-start=3D"1991" data-end=3D"2082"><code data-start=3D"1991" data-end=
=3D"2004">wait(mutex)</code> =E2=86=92 ensure <strong data-start=3D"2014" d=
ata-end=3D"2028">read_count</strong> is updated safely (mutual exclusion am=
ong readers).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2083" data-end=3D"2140">
<p data-start=3D"2086" data-end=3D"2140"><code data-start=3D"2086" data-end=
=3D"2100">read_count++</code> =E2=86=92 increment number of active readers.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2141" data-end=3D"2238">
<p data-start=3D"2144" data-end=3D"2238"><strong data-start=3D"2144" data-e=
nd=3D"2180">First reader (<code data-start=3D"2160" data-end=3D"2177">read_=
count =3D=3D 1</code>)</strong>: locks <code data-start=3D"2188" data-end=
=3D"2198">rw_mutex</code> to <strong data-start=3D"2202" data-end=3D"2221">=
prevent writers</strong> from entering.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2239" data-end=3D"2335">
<p data-start=3D"2242" data-end=3D"2335"><strong data-start=3D"2242" data-e=
nd=3D"2264">Subsequent readers</strong>: no need to lock <code data-start=
=3D"2282" data-end=3D"2292">rw_mutex</code>; multiple readers can read conc=
urrently.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2336" data-end=3D"2402">
<p data-start=3D"2339" data-end=3D"2402"><code data-start=3D"2339" data-end=
=3D"2354">signal(mutex)</code> =E2=86=92 allow other readers to update <cod=
e data-start=3D"2387" data-end=3D"2399">read_count</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2403" data-end=3D"2465">
<p data-start=3D"2406" data-end=3D"2465"><strong data-start=3D"2406" data-e=
nd=3D"2425">Reading happens</strong> (multiple readers can read together).<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2466" data-end=3D"2711">
<p data-start=3D"2469" data-end=3D"2483">After reading:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2487" data-end=3D"2711">
<li data-start=3D"2487" data-end=3D"2525">
<p data-start=3D"2489" data-end=3D"2525"><code data-start=3D"2489" data-end=
=3D"2502">wait(mutex)</code> =E2=86=92 lock <code data-start=3D"2510" data-=
end=3D"2522">read_count</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2529" data-end=3D"2573">
<p data-start=3D"2531" data-end=3D"2573"><code data-start=3D"2531" data-end=
=3D"2545">read_count--</code> =E2=86=92 decrement reader count.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2577" data-end=3D"2655">
<p data-start=3D"2579" data-end=3D"2655"><strong data-start=3D"2579" data-e=
nd=3D"2614">Last reader (<code data-start=3D"2594" data-end=3D"2611">read_c=
ount =3D=3D 0</code>)</strong> =E2=86=92 release <code data-start=3D"2625" =
data-end=3D"2635">rw_mutex</code> to allow writers.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2659" data-end=3D"2711">
<p data-start=3D"2661" data-end=3D"2711"><code data-start=3D"2661" data-end=
=3D"2676">signal(mutex)</code> =E2=86=92 release read_count protection.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"2713" data-end=3D"2716">
<h1 data-start=3D"2718" data-end=3D"2754">=F0=9F=9F=A1 <strong data-start=
=3D"2723" data-end=3D"2754">How It Works (Step-by-Step)</strong></h1>
<ol data-start=3D"2756" data-end=3D"3175">
<li data-start=3D"2756" data-end=3D"2863">
<p data-start=3D"2759" data-end=3D"2788"><strong data-start=3D"2759" data-e=
nd=3D"2787">Multiple readers allowed</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2792" data-end=3D"2863">
<li data-start=3D"2792" data-end=3D"2863">
<p data-start=3D"2794" data-end=3D"2863">If <code data-start=3D"2797" data-=
end=3D"2813">read_count &gt; 0</code> and no writer is active =E2=86=92 all=
 readers can read.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2864" data-end=3D"2976">
<p data-start=3D"2867" data-end=3D"2888"><strong data-start=3D"2867" data-e=
nd=3D"2887">Writer exclusion</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2892" data-end=3D"2976">
<li data-start=3D"2892" data-end=3D"2976">
<p data-start=3D"2894" data-end=3D"2976">When a writer calls <code data-sta=
rt=3D"2914" data-end=3D"2930">wait(rw_mutex)</code>, no reader can read (<c=
ode data-start=3D"2952" data-end=3D"2962">rw_mutex</code> is locked).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2977" data-end=3D"3082">
<p data-start=3D"2980" data-end=3D"3011"><strong data-start=3D"2980" data-e=
nd=3D"3010">First reader locks writers</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3015" data-end=3D"3082">
<li data-start=3D"3015" data-end=3D"3082">
<p data-start=3D"3017" data-end=3D"3082">Only the <strong data-start=3D"302=
6" data-end=3D"3042">first reader</strong> acquires <code data-start=3D"305=
2" data-end=3D"3062">rw_mutex</code> to block writers.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3083" data-end=3D"3175">
<p data-start=3D"3086" data-end=3D"3118"><strong data-start=3D"3086" data-e=
nd=3D"3117">Last reader unlocks writers</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3122" data-end=3D"3175">
<li data-start=3D"3122" data-end=3D"3175">
<p data-start=3D"3124" data-end=3D"3175">After last reader leaves, <code da=
ta-start=3D"3150" data-end=3D"3160">rw_mutex</code> is released.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"3177" data-end=3D"3180">
<h1 data-start=3D"3182" data-end=3D"3207">=F0=9F=9F=A1 <strong data-start=
=3D"3187" data-end=3D"3207">Important Points</strong></h1>
<ul data-start=3D"3209" data-end=3D"3482">
<li data-start=3D"3209" data-end=3D"3263">
<p data-start=3D"3211" data-end=3D"3263"><code data-start=3D"3211" data-end=
=3D"3218">mutex</code> ensures <strong data-start=3D"3227" data-end=3D"3260=
">read_count updates are atomic</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3264" data-end=3D"3320">
<p data-start=3D"3266" data-end=3D"3320"><code data-start=3D"3266" data-end=
=3D"3276">rw_mutex</code> ensures <strong data-start=3D"3285" data-end=3D"3=
317">writers get exclusive access</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3321" data-end=3D"3412">
<p data-start=3D"3323" data-end=3D"3350">Allows <strong data-start=3D"3330"=
 data-end=3D"3349">reader priority</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3353" data-end=3D"3412">
<li data-start=3D"3353" data-end=3D"3412">
<p data-start=3D"3355" data-end=3D"3412">If readers arrive continuously, wr=
iters may <strong data-start=3D"3399" data-end=3D"3409">starve</strong>.</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3413" data-end=3D"3482">
<p data-start=3D"3415" data-end=3D"3482">Can be modified for <strong data-s=
tart=3D"3435" data-end=3D"3454">writer-priority</strong> or <strong data-st=
