<h3 data-start=3D"1301" data-end=3D"1321">=F0=9F=94=8E How it works:</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"1322" data-end=3D"1556">
<li data-start=3D"1322" data-end=3D"1383">
<p data-start=3D"1325" data-end=3D"1383"><code data-start=3D"1325" data-end=
=3D"1345">wait(chopstick[i])</code> =E2=86=92 pick left chopstick if availa=
ble.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1384" data-end=3D"1454">
<p data-start=3D"1387" data-end=3D"1454"><code data-start=3D"1387" data-end=
=3D"1415">wait(chopstick[(i+1) % 5])</code> =E2=86=92 pick right chopstick =
if available.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1455" data-end=3D"1513">
<p data-start=3D"1458" data-end=3D"1513">After eating, <strong data-start=
=3D"1472" data-end=3D"1499">release both chopsticks</strong> (<code data-st=
art=3D"1501" data-end=3D"1509">signal</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1514" data-end=3D"1556">
<p data-start=3D"1517" data-end=3D"1556">Then philosopher goes back to thin=
king.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"1558" data-end=3D"1561">
<h1 data-start=3D"1563" data-end=3D"1604">=F0=9F=9F=A1 Problem with This So=
lution: Deadlock</h1>
<ul data-start=3D"1606" data-end=3D"1680">
<li data-start=3D"1606" data-end=3D"1680">
<p data-start=3D"1608" data-end=3D"1680">Deadlock can occur <strong data-st=
art=3D"1627" data-end=3D"1679">if all philosophers become hungry simultaneo=
usly</strong>:</p>
</li>
</ul>
<ol data-start=3D"1682" data-end=3D"1869">
<li data-start=3D"1682" data-end=3D"1735">
<p data-start=3D"1685" data-end=3D"1735">Each philosopher picks their <stro=
ng data-start=3D"1714" data-end=3D"1732">left chopstick</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1736" data-end=3D"1817">
<p data-start=3D"1739" data-end=3D"1817">Now all <strong data-start=3D"1747=
" data-end=3D"1770">chopsticks are held</strong> =E2=86=92 no one can pick =
their <strong data-start=3D"1795" data-end=3D"1814">right chopstick</strong=
>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1818" data-end=3D"1869">
<p data-start=3D"1821" data-end=3D"1869">Each philosopher waits <strong dat=
a-start=3D"1844" data-end=3D"1855">forever</strong> =E2=86=92 deadlock.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<ul data-start=3D"1871" data-end=3D"2074">
<li data-start=3D"1871" data-end=3D"2074">
<p data-start=3D"1873" data-end=3D"1881"><strong data-start=3D"1873" data-e=
nd=3D"1881">Why?</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1884" data-end=3D"2074">
<li data-start=3D"1884" data-end=3D"1979">
<p data-start=3D"1886" data-end=3D"1979">All resources are <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"1904" data-end=3D"1925">held but not used</strong>, and everyone wait=
s for a resource held by another.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1982" data-end=3D"2074">
<p data-start=3D"1984" data-end=3D"2074">This is a <strong data-start=3D"19=
94" data-end=3D"2011">circular wait</strong> condition =E2=80=94 one of the=
 four necessary conditions for deadlock.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2076" data-end=3D"2079">
<h1 data-start=3D"2081" data-end=3D"2113">=F0=9F=9F=A1 Key Points to Write =
in Exam</h1>
<ol data-start=3D"2115" data-end=3D"2490">
<li data-start=3D"2115" data-end=3D"2202">
<p data-start=3D"2118" data-end=3D"2202"><strong data-start=3D"2118" data-e=
nd=3D"2129">Concept</strong>: Philosophers share chopsticks, must pick two =
to eat, think otherwise.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2203" data-end=3D"2266">
<p data-start=3D"2206" data-end=3D"2266"><strong data-start=3D"2206" data-e=
nd=3D"2234">Semaphore representation</strong>: One semaphore per chopstick.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2267" data-end=3D"2331">
<p data-start=3D"2270" data-end=3D"2331"><strong data-start=3D"2270" data-e=
nd=3D"2288">Naive solution</strong>: pick left =E2=86=92 pick right =E2=86=
=92 eat =E2=86=92 release.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2332" data-end=3D"2414">
<p data-start=3D"2335" data-end=3D"2414"><strong data-start=3D"2335" data-e=
nd=3D"2346">Problem</strong>: Deadlock if all philosophers grab left chopst=
ick simultaneously.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2415" data-end=3D"2490">
<p data-start=3D"2418" data-end=3D"2490"><strong data-start=3D"2418" data-e=
nd=3D"2428">Reason</strong>: Circular wait, no process can proceed, resourc=
es are held.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"2492" data-end=3D"2495">
<h1 data-start=3D"2497" data-end=3D"2560">=F0=9F=9F=A1 Solutions to Avoid D=
eadlock (Optional, High-Value in Exam)</h1>
<ol data-start=3D"2562" data-end=3D"3177">
<li data-start=3D"2562" data-end=3D"2742">
<p data-start=3D"2565" data-end=3D"2610"><strong data-start=3D"2565" data-e=
nd=3D"2610">Resource Hierarchy (Numbering Chopsticks)</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2614" data-end=3D"2742">
<li data-start=3D"2614" data-end=3D"2693">
<p data-start=3D"2616" data-end=3D"2693">Philosophers pick <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"2634" data-end=3D"2690">lower-numbered chopstick first, then higher-n=
umbered</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2697" data-end=3D"2742">
<p data-start=3D"2699" data-end=3D"2742">Breaks circular wait =E2=86=92 pre=
vents deadlock.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2744" data-end=3D"2858">
<p data-start=3D"2747" data-end=3D"2799"><strong data-start=3D"2747" data-e=
nd=3D"2799">Allow at most 4 philosophers to sit at the table</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2803" data-end=3D"2858">
<li data-start=3D"2803" data-end=3D"2858">
<p data-start=3D"2805" data-end=3D"2858">Guarantees at least one can eat =
=E2=86=92 deadlock avoided.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2860" data-end=3D"3045">
<p data-start=3D"2863" data-end=3D"2886"><strong data-start=3D"2863" data-e=
nd=3D"2886">Asymmetric Solution</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2890" data-end=3D"3045">
<li data-start=3D"2890" data-end=3D"2939">
<p data-start=3D"2892" data-end=3D"2939">Even-numbered philosophers pick le=
ft =E2=86=92 right.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2943" data-end=3D"2991">
<p data-start=3D"2945" data-end=3D"2991">Odd-numbered philosophers pick rig=
ht =E2=86=92 left.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2995" data-end=3D"3045">
<p data-start=3D"2997" data-end=3D"3045">Prevents all from holding left sim=
ultaneously.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3047" data-end=3D"3177">
<p data-start=3D"3050" data-end=3D"3072"><strong data-start=3D"3050" data-e=
nd=3D"3072">Use a single mutex</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3076" data-end=3D"3177">
<li data-start=3D"3076" data-end=3D"3177">
<p data-start=3D"3078" data-end=3D"3177">Lock entire table before picking c=
hopsticks =E2=86=92 ensures <strong data-start=3D"3132" data-end=3D"3152">m=
utual exclusion</strong> but reduces concurrency.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"3179" data-end=3D"3182">
<h1 data-start=3D"3184" data-end=3D"3206">=F0=9F=9F=A1 Real-Life Analogy</h=
1>
<ul data-start=3D"3208" data-end=3D"3361">
<li data-start=3D"3208" data-end=3D"3252">
<p data-start=3D"3210" data-end=3D"3252">Five people sharing <strong data-s=
tart=3D"3230" data-end=3D"3249">forks at dinner</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3253" data-end=3D"3289">
<p data-start=3D"3255" data-end=3D"3289">Each needs <strong data-start=3D"3=
266" data-end=3D"3286">two forks to eat</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3290" data-end=3D"3361">
<p data-start=3D"3292" data-end=3D"3361">If everyone grabs the <strong data=
-start=3D"3314" data-end=3D"3333">left fork first</strong>, no one can eat =
=E2=86=92 deadlock.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3363" data-end=3D"3366">
<p data-start=3D"3368" data-end=3D"3382">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"33=
