ata-end=3D"3434">circle with philosophers and chopsticks</strong> =E2=86=92=
 mark left/right picks.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3462" data-end=3D"3523">
<p data-start=3D"3464" data-end=3D"3523">Explain <strong data-start=3D"3472=
" data-end=3D"3493">deadlock scenario</strong> =E2=86=92 shows deep underst=
anding.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3524" data-end=3D"3574">
<p data-start=3D"3526" data-end=3D"3574">Mention at least <strong data-star=
t=3D"3543" data-end=3D"3559">one solution</strong> =E2=86=92 extra marks.</=
