<li data-start=3D"545" data-end=3D"626">
<p data-start=3D"547" data-end=3D"626"><strong data-start=3D"547" data-end=
=3D"555">Goal</strong>: Use semaphores to allow <strong data-start=3D"581" =
data-end=3D"596">safe access</strong>, maintaining the rules above.</p>
