<h3 data-start=3D"2894" data-end=3D"2913">=F0=9F=94=91 How it Works</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"2915" data-end=3D"3213">
<li data-start=3D"2915" data-end=3D"2976">
<p data-start=3D"2918" data-end=3D"2976"><strong data-start=3D"2918" data-e=
nd=3D"2937">Queue semaphore</strong> ensures <strong data-start=3D"2946" da=
ta-end=3D"2973">first-come-first-served</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2977" data-end=3D"3076">
<p data-start=3D"2980" data-end=3D"3076"><strong data-start=3D"2980" data-e=
nd=3D"3000">Multiple readers</strong> can still read concurrently if <stron=
g data-start=3D"3032" data-end=3D"3073">no writer is waiting at head of que=
ue</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3077" data-end=3D"3159">
<p data-start=3D"3080" data-end=3D"3159"><strong data-start=3D"3080" data-e=
nd=3D"3091">Writers</strong> block new readers until they finish =E2=86=92 =
prevents writer starvation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3160" data-end=3D"3213">
<p data-start=3D"3163" data-end=3D"3213"><strong data-start=3D"3163" data-e=
nd=3D"3180">No starvation</strong> for either readers or writers.</p>
</li>
</ol>
