<p data-start=3D"4273" data-end=3D"4383"><strong data-start=3D"4273" data-e=
nd=3D"4283">Result</strong>: Efficient (multiple readers), fair (writers no=
t starved), correct (mutual exclusion maintained).</p>
</li>
</ol>
